{
  "$comment": "Single source of truth for the telemetry channel catalog. Generated into firmware/cdo-edge-gateway/catalog.h by scripts/gen-catalog.mjs, read by the backend simulator, and asserted against the simulator's birth message by a backend test, so the C++ and JavaScript sides cannot drift. Limits are illustrative constants chosen for the demo, not vendor values.",
